# Most Asked Interview Questions

## 1. Display all students with city names.

```sql
SELECT s.Name,
       c.CityName
FROM Student s
INNER JOIN City c
ON s.CityId = c.CityId;
```

---

## 2. Display all students from Pune.

```sql
SELECT s.Name,
       c.CityName
FROM Student s
INNER JOIN City c
ON s.CityId = c.CityId
WHERE c.CityName='Pune';
```

---

## 3. Count students city-wise.

```sql
SELECT c.CityName,
       COUNT(*) AS TotalStudents
FROM Student s
INNER JOIN City c
ON s.CityId=c.CityId
GROUP BY c.CityName;
```

---

## 4. Average score city-wise.

```sql
SELECT c.CityName,
       AVG(s.Score)
FROM Student s
INNER JOIN City c
ON s.CityId=c.CityId
GROUP BY c.CityName;
```

---

## 5. Highest score city-wise.

```sql
SELECT c.CityName,
       MAX(s.Score)
FROM Student s
INNER JOIN City c
ON s.CityId=c.CityId
GROUP BY c.CityName;
```

---

## 6. Display customers with orders.

```sql
SELECT c.first_name,
       c.last_name,
       o.item
FROM Customers c
INNER JOIN Orders o
ON c.customer_id=o.customer_id;
```

---

## 7. Count total orders per customer.

```sql
SELECT c.first_name,
       c.last_name,
       COUNT(o.order_id) AS TotalOrders
FROM Customers c
INNER JOIN Orders o
ON c.customer_id=o.customer_id
GROUP BY c.customer_id,
         c.first_name,
         c.last_name;
```

---

## 8. Customer who placed the highest number of orders.

```sql
SELECT c.first_name,
       c.last_name,
       COUNT(o.order_id) AS TotalOrders
FROM Customers c
INNER JOIN Orders o
ON c.customer_id=o.customer_id
GROUP BY c.customer_id,
         c.first_name,
         c.last_name
ORDER BY TotalOrders DESC
LIMIT 1;
```

---

## 9. Display customer with shipping status.

```sql
SELECT c.first_name,
       c.last_name,
       s.status
FROM Customers c
INNER JOIN Shippings s
ON c.customer_id=s.customer;
```

---

## 10. Display customer, order, amount and shipping status.

```sql
SELECT c.first_name,
       c.last_name,
       o.item,
       o.amount,
       s.status
FROM Customers c
INNER JOIN Orders o
ON c.customer_id=o.customer_id
INNER JOIN Shippings s
ON c.customer_id=s.customer;
```

